-y-mas-en-claro_ver-mas-informacion" data-module="C62" data-variant="V2" data-slot="1" class="btni bcoNegroTer" href="https://tienda.claro.com.pe/personas/hogar/internet/?initialMap=c,c,c&initialQuery=personas/hogar/internet&map=category-1,category-2,category-3,mas-sobre-hogar&query=/personas/hogar/internet/internet-y-claro-tv-&searchState&utm_campaign=performance_hogar&utm_source=medios_propios&utm_medium=claro_pe&utm_content=internas-titulo_h1_home_personas&utm_term=hogar-linea_nueva&cu=cp1781216012" target="_self"><span>Ver más información</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class="sc_articles"><div class="container"><h2 class="sc_articles__title">Descubre los descuentos</h2></div><div class="container containerSliderTienda"><div class="sc_articles__wrapper"><div class="sc_articles__list"><div class="slick-slide" data-campaign-slot><div class="sc_articles__card"><div class="contentImg"><img src="https://www.claro.com.pe/assets/havas/claro-home/assets/articulos/globo.png" alt="" class="globo"><img class="sc_articles__card__image blanco" src="https://www.claro.com.pe/assets/havas/claro-home/assets/articulos/wowV2.png" alt="Los top del cyber"></div><div class="sc_articles__card__body"><p class="sc_articles__card__body__title">Los top del cyber</p></div><a href="https://tienda.claro.com.pe/cyber-claro?srsltid=AU7gw4U5y6z9GF2MZkafUNY4bUzJNLw0m6xtVGMNuPUlZNDVsaAcdJAY&utm_campaign=cyber_claro&utm_source=medios_propios&utm_medium=claro_pe&utm_content=internas-cyber_claro_tiendaclaro&utm_term=postpago-portabilidad%2Brenovacion&cu=cp1792421473" class="sc_articles__card__btn" aria-label="Cyber wow"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.65039 1L14.3004 8L7.65039 15" stroke="#1D1D1D" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1 8L14.3 8Z" fill="url(#paint0_linear_235_50)"/><path d="M1 8L14.3 8" stroke="#1D1D1D" stroke-width="2